      <trans-unit id="EjwPbe_" resname="text.team.gabriel">
        <source>text.team.gabriel</source>
        <target><![CDATA[Attracted by new technologies since very young,<br />I passionate about IT and more specifically Internet and Web thereafter.<br />I made this passion my profession when entering the active life. My curiosity and taste of challenges I have to create the IDCI-Consulting company in end of 2007.<br />The philosophy of "Open Source" make me a satisfied libriste. RFC 2616 has become my "holy book" and the number 42 is often a choice of response to the problems I get asked.]]></target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="PallEu3" resname="text.team.frederic">
        <source>text.team.frederic</source>
        <target><![CDATA[Previously from the world of IT services, I am co-founder of IDCI-Consulting since 2007.<br />Today I put my 18 years of experience in the company's development.<br />In addition to the strategic directions that I determine with Baptiste & Gabriel, I manage particularly trade negotiations, finance and HRs to allow the operations team to focus on his heart craft.]]></target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="aTDI0bm" resname="text.team.brahim">
        <source>text.team.brahim</source>
        <target><![CDATA[Even though I fell in the IT world by chance, I stayed by passion.<br />Most of all, I love learning new things every days and use my knowledge to build apps easing everyday life.<br />My desire of freedom lead me to join IDCI-Consulting as a partner in 2015.<br />I hope I will always keep learning as well as discovering new activity fields by diving into the worlds of my clients.]]></target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="J7svU0K" resname="text.team.baptiste">
        <source>text.team.baptiste</source>
        <target><![CDATA[<blockquote cite="Albert Einstein">«Everybody is a genius. But if you judge a fish by its ability to climb a tree, it will live its whole life believing that it is stupid.» - Albert Einstein</blockquote><br /><br />Initially, the IT world was not a familiar environment.<br />After nights and days of learning, I was passionate about this area.<br />Today, I like to translate ideas into a program and share my knowledge.]]></target>
      </trans-unit>
